<title>JAPAN: Hinoki Real Estate - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Hinoki Real Estate - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  6.39		vs	    4.15</p>
<p> Operating	  202 million	 vs	  440 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 676 million	 vs   loss 749 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 568 million	 vs   loss 798 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 17.88 yen	  vs    loss 25.10 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     32 million	  vs	  32 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Hinoki Real Estate Co Ltd deals in the sale of condominiums.</p>
